---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout current="/" description="Richard J. Allen is an operations and customer-success leader with experience in people management, SaaS support, process improvement, training, reporting, and cross-functional execution.">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow">Operations · Customer Success · Process Improvement · People Leadership</div>
        <h1>Build better systems.<br/><span>Help people do better work.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">I’m Richard Allen, an Oregon-based operations and customer-success leader. I’ve managed teams, led process and documentation programs, built management reporting, coordinated major software changes and migrations, and helped turn complex work into something clearer, measurable, and repeatable.</p>
        <div class="actions hero-actions">
          <a class="button" href="/case-studies/">Explore selected work</a>
          <a class="button hero-button-secondary" href="/resume/">View résumé</a>
          <a class="hero-text-link" href="/contact/">Contact me →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-proof-line" aria-label="Selected career proof">
          <span><strong>32</strong> people managed</span>
          <span><strong>125+</strong> SOP program</span>
          <span><strong>400+</strong> positions managed</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Richard Allen operating model: people, systems, information, and change leading to better operations">
        <div class="hero-visual-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="visual-kicker">HOW I OPERATE</div>
        <div class="operating-wheel">
          <div class="wheel-center"><span>BETTER</span><strong>OPERATIONS</strong><small>clear · measurable · repeatable</small></div>
          <div class="wheel-node node-people"><span>PEOPLE</span><strong>32</strong><small>support & technical-support reps</small></div>
          <div class="wheel-node node-process"><span>PROCESS</span><strong>125+</strong><small>SOP program</small></div>
          <div class="wheel-node node-data"><span>DATA</span><strong>400+</strong><small>position records</small></div>
          <div class="wheel-node node-change"><span>CHANGE</span><strong>1+ mo.</strong><small>migration ahead of deadline</small></div>
          <div class="orbit orbit-one" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="orbit orbit-two" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="visual-caption">People + process + useful information + disciplined change</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="proof-band" aria-label="Career impact at a glance">
    <div class="container proof-strip">
      <div class="proof-item proof-teal"><strong>32</strong><span>Customer Support & Technical Support representatives managed as Customer Support Manager</span></div>
      <div class="proof-item proof-blue"><strong>125+</strong><span>SOPs encompassed by a year-long modernization and governance program</span></div>
      <div class="proof-item proof-gold"><strong>400+</strong><span>workforce position records managed across multiple OHA divisions</span></div>
      <div class="proof-item proof-violet"><strong>20+</strong><span>recurring and ad-hoc workforce reports maintained for leadership</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section featured-work-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading-row home-heading">
        <div><div class="eyebrow">Featured work</div><h2>Three examples that show how I lead.</h2></div>
        <p class="section-note">A recruiter-level view of the problem, operating approach, and result. More detail lives in the case studies.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="featured-grid">
        <article class="feature-card feature-teal">
          <div class="feature-topline"><span>HAWKSOFT</span><span>PEOPLE MANAGEMENT</span></div>
          <div class="feature-visual org-visual" aria-label="Management scope: 32 support and technical support representatives, plus four team leads not included in the 32">
            <div class="manager-node">CUSTOMER SUPPORT<br/><strong>MANAGER</strong></div>
            <div class="org-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="lead-row">
              <span>TEAM LEAD</span><span>TEAM LEAD</span><span>TEAM LEAD</span><span>TEAM LEAD</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rep-block"><strong>32</strong><span>Customer Support + Technical Support representatives</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-copy">
            <div class="feature-number">01</div>
            <div><h3>Managing support operations at scale</h3><p>Promoted from Team Lead to Customer Support Manager in 2015, with hiring and disciplinary authority, performance management, coaching, quality review, workflow coverage, escalations, and operational reporting.</p><a href="/operations-leadership/">See operations leadership →</a></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card feature-blue">
          <div class="feature-topline"><span>OREGON EMPLOYMENT DEPARTMENT</span><span>PROCESS GOVERNANCE</span></div>
          <div class="feature-visual sop-visual" aria-label="SOP modernization flow from fragmented procedures through standards and review to a governed library of 125-plus SOPs">
            <div class="sop-stage stage-scattered">
              <div class="paper-stack" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
              <span>Fragmented</span><small>legacy + missing procedures</small>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-chevron" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
            <div class="sop-stage stage-govern">
              <div class="govern-ring">STD</div>
              <span>Standardize</span><small>templates · review · coaching</small>
            </div>
            <div class="flow-chevron" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
            <div class="sop-stage stage-library">
              <strong>125+</strong>
              <span>Governed library</span><small>including 25+ legacy procedures updated</small>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-copy">
            <div class="feature-number">02</div>
            <div><h3>Leading a year-long SOP modernization program</h3><p>Led the effort across roughly 10 functional groups, building standards, review controls, contributor coaching, centralized storage, and an ongoing maintenance foundation.</p><a href="/process-improvement/">See process improvement →</a></div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card feature-violet feature-wide">
          <div class="feature-topline"><span>HAWKSOFT</span><span>MIGRATION & CHANGE</span></div>
          <div class="feature-visual migration-visual" aria-label="Migration of hundreds of insurance agencies from a legacy hosted environment to a replacement provider, completed at least one month ahead of deadline">
            <div class="environment legacy-env"><span>LEGACY</span><strong>Hosted environment</strong></div>
            <div class="migration-track">
              <div class="agency-cloud" aria-hidden="true">
                <i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i>
              </div>
              <div class="track-line"><span></span></div>
              <div class="migration-label"><strong>Hundreds</strong><span>of insurance agencies</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="environment new-env"><span>REPLACEMENT</span><strong>Hosted provider</strong><small>completed <b>1+ month early</b></small></div>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-copy">
            <div class="feature-number">03</div>
            <div><h3>Moving hundreds of agencies through a critical hosting transition</h3><p>Project-managed and coordinated the migration while keeping customer communication, technical work, and support continuity connected. The transition finished at least one month ahead of the critical deadline.</p><a href="/implementation-enablement/">See implementation & enablement →</a></div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="center-action"><a class="button secondary" href="/case-studies/">View all case studies</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section role-paths-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading-row home-heading">
        <div><div class="eyebrow">Choose your path</div><h2>Explore the experience most relevant to your role.</h2></div>
        <p class="section-note">One career history, organized through four hiring lenses.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="role-path-grid">
        <a class="role-path path-teal" href="/operations-leadership/">
          <span class="path-number">01</span><div class="path-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</div><h3>Operations & People Leadership</h3><p>Management, performance, workflow, reporting, strategy alignment, workforce operations, and supply leadership.</p><span class="path-link">Explore leadership →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="role-path path-blue" href="/customer-success/">
          <span class="path-number">02</span><div class="path-icon" aria-hidden="true">◎</div><h3>Customer Success & Operations</h3><p>Customer relationships, SaaS support, escalations, journey leadership, training, retention, and service improvement.</p><span class="path-link">Explore customer work →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="role-path path-gold" href="/process-improvement/">
          <span class="path-number">03</span><div class="path-icon" aria-hidden="true">⇄</div><h3>Process Improvement</h3><p>SOP governance, workflow documentation, quality, reporting, standardization, and continuous improvement.</p><span class="path-link">Explore process work →</span>
        </a>
        <a class="role-path path-violet" href="/implementation-enablement/">
          <span class="path-number">04</span><div class="path-icon" aria-hidden="true">∆</div><h3>Implementation & Enablement</h3><p>Migrations, release readiness, functional testing, documentation, training, onboarding, and change adoption.</p><span class="path-link">Explore implementation →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section career-arc-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading-row home-heading arc-heading">
        <div><div class="eyebrow light">Career arc</div><h2>Operations leadership built across different environments.</h2></div>
        <p class="section-note arc-note">The industries changed. The recurring work—people, processes, systems, reporting, training, and change—did not.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="career-arc" aria-label="Career progression from warehouse operations through software leadership to public-sector operations">
        <div class="arc-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="arc-stop"><span class="arc-dot"></span><small>2001–03</small><strong>Aramark</strong><p>Warehouse & supply management</p></div>
        <div class="arc-stop"><span class="arc-dot"></span><small>2012–18</small><strong>HawkSoft</strong><p>Team Lead → Customer Support Manager</p></div>
        <div class="arc-stop"><span class="arc-dot"></span><small>2019–20</small><strong>Kotter Group</strong><p>Customer Experience / Customer Success</p></div>
        <div class="arc-stop"><span class="arc-dot"></span><small>2021–23</small><strong>OED + OHA</strong><p>Process, policy & workforce operations</p></div>
        <div class="arc-stop"><span class="arc-dot"></span><small>2024–26</small><strong>Marion County</strong><p>Administrative operations & reporting</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="arc-action"><a class="button hero-button-secondary" href="/resume/">View the full career timeline</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section project-work-home"><div class="container">
    <div class="project-teaser">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow light">Secondary project-work pathway</div>
        <h2>Need an important process documented clearly?</h2>
        <p>Alongside my primary search for the right long-term role, I take on selected short-term projects involving SOP creation and cleanup, workflow documentation, training/onboarding guides, support procedures, and documentation governance.</p>
        <div class="service-chips"><span>SOPs</span><span>Workflow documentation</span><span>Training guides</span><span>Support procedures</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="project-actions"><a class="button button-light" href="/project-work/">View project services</a><a class="text-link-light" href="/contact/">Discuss a project →</a></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section community-home-section"><div class="container">
    <div class="community-home-card">
      <div class="community-mark" aria-hidden="true">+</div>
      <div><div class="eyebrow">Leadership beyond the workplace</div><h2>Service reinforces the same operating habits.</h2><p>Volunteer hospital chaplaincy, community administration, emergency-preparedness coordination, mentoring, and service work reinforce listening, organization, communication, discretion, and follow-through.</p></div>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/community-leadership/">Explore community leadership</a>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <style>
    .home-hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:5.4rem 0 4.7rem;background:linear-gradient(128deg,#0f2d52 0%,#153e75 44%,#0c5b60 100%);color:#fff}
    .home-hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;width:520px;height:520px;border-radius:50%;right:-170px;top:-230px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);box-shadow:0 0 0 68px rgba(255,255,255,.025),0 0 0 138px rgba(255,255,255,.018)}
    .home-hero:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0;height:160px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(6,24,43,.22));pointer-events:none}
    .hero-grid{position:relative;z-index:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.12fr) minmax(390px,.88fr);gap:4rem;align-items:center}
    .hero-copy{max-width:690px}.hero-eyebrow{color:#9fe6dc}.home-hero h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,5.65rem);line-height:.98;margin:.9rem 0 1.4rem;max-width:760px;letter-spacing:-.055em}.home-hero h1 span{color:#b6efe5}.hero-lede{font-size:clamp(1.05rem,1.8vw,1.28rem);line-height:1.65;color:#e1edf5;max-width:670px}.hero-actions{align-items:center}.hero-button-secondary{background:transparent!important;color:#fff!important;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.52)!important}.hero-button-secondary:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1)!important}.hero-text-link{color:#d7fff7;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;padding:.7rem .2rem}.hero-text-link:hover{color:#fff}.hero-proof-line{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.7rem 1.2rem;margin-top:2rem;padding-top:1.2rem;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);color:#dce9f1;font-size:.84rem}.hero-proof-line span{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:.35rem}.hero-proof-line strong{font-size:1.1rem;color:#fff}
    .hero-visual{position:relative;min-height:510px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.17);border-radius:34px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(255,255,255,.12),rgba(255,255,255,.045));box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(4,19,36,.34);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);padding:1.35rem;overflow:hidden}.hero-visual-glow{position:absolute;width:280px;height:280px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(85,214,198,.28),transparent 68%);left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%)}.visual-kicker{font-size:.69rem;letter-spacing:.17em;font-weight:900;color:#a6eee4}.operating-wheel{position:relative;height:405px;margin-top:.4rem}.wheel-center,.wheel-node{position:absolute;z-index:2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center}.wheel-center{width:168px;height:168px;border-radius:50%;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff,#edf9f7);color:#123a55;box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(2,18,36,.25);border:8px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28)}.wheel-center span{font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:900;color:var(--teal)}.wheel-center strong{font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.05}.wheel-center small{font-size:.67rem;color:#57707e;margin-top:.35rem}.wheel-node{width:124px;height:106px;border-radius:20px;padding:.55rem;background:rgba(8,31,55,.72);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(2,18,36,.2)}.wheel-node span{font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.13em;font-weight:900;color:#a8ddd7}.wheel-node strong{font-size:1.55rem;line-height:1.05;color:#fff;margin:.18rem 0}.wheel-node small{font-size:.65rem;line-height:1.2;color:#cbdce6}.node-people{left:0;top:35px}.node-process{right:0;top:38px}.node-data{left:5px;bottom:27px}.node-change{right:5px;bottom:25px}.orbit{position:absolute;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);border-radius:50%;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%)}.orbit-one{width:330px;height:260px}.orbit-two{width:270px;height:345px}.visual-caption{text-align:center;color:#c5d9e3;font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.04em}
    .proof-band{background:#0d243f;color:#fff;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}.proof-strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.proof-item{position:relative;padding:1.4rem 1.2rem 1.45rem 1.4rem;border-right:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);min-height:132px;overflow:hidden}.proof-item:last-child{border-right:0}.proof-item:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:5px;background:var(--proof)}.proof-item strong{display:block;font-size:2.6rem;line-height:1;font-weight:900;color:var(--proof-light);letter-spacing:-.05em}.proof-item span{display:block;font-size:.79rem;line-height:1.35;color:#cedae4;margin-top:.55rem}.proof-teal{--proof:#31c7b5;--proof-light:#8fe3d7}.proof-blue{--proof:#63a6e8;--proof-light:#9ec9f2}.proof-gold{--proof:#d9a441;--proof-light:#f3c66f}.proof-violet{--proof:#9589dd;--proof-light:#c3baf2}
    .featured-work-section{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f7f8fa 0%,#fff 30%,#f5f8fb 100%);padding-top:5rem}.home-heading{margin-bottom:2rem}.home-heading h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.25rem);max-width:720px}.featured-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.25rem}.feature-card{--feature:var(--teal);background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:26px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 18px 46px rgba(23,32,42,.075);transition:transform .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease}.feature-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 24px 56px rgba(23,32,42,.12)}.feature-teal{--feature:var(--teal)}.feature-blue{--feature:var(--accent-2)}.feature-violet{--feature:var(--violet)}.feature-wide{grid-column:1/-1}.feature-topline{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;padding:.8rem 1.1rem;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--feature) 10%,white);border-bottom:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--feature) 18%,white);font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:900;color:var(--feature)}.feature-visual{min-height:280px;padding:1.4rem;background:linear-gradient(145deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--feature) 8%,#f8fafc),#fff);position:relative}.feature-copy{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:1rem;padding:1.4rem 1.45rem 1.55rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}.feature-number{font-weight:900;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--feature) 75%,#111);font-size:.76rem;letter-spacing:.12em;padding-top:.15rem}.feature-copy h3{font-size:1.4rem;margin-bottom:.55rem}.feature-copy p{color:var(--muted);margin:.2rem 0 .7rem}.feature-copy a{font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;color:var(--feature)}
    .org-visual{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.manager-node{position:relative;z-index:2;background:#0d3f47;color:#dffaf5;border-radius:16px;padding:.85rem 1.15rem;text-align:center;font-size:.64rem;letter-spacing:.1em;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(15,118,110,.2)}.manager-node strong{font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.03em}.org-line{width:76%;height:28px;border-left:2px solid #9dd6ce;border-right:2px solid #9dd6ce;border-top:2px solid #9dd6ce;margin-top:0}.lead-row{width:84%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:.45rem}.lead-row span{padding:.55rem .2rem;background:#e8f7f4;color:#0d635d;border:1px solid #c1e6df;border-radius:9px;text-align:center;font-size:.57rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.06em}.rep-block{margin-top:1rem;width:84%;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.85rem;padding:.8rem 1rem;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dceae7;box-shadow:0 7px 18px rgba(15,118,110,.07)}.rep-block strong{font-size:2.4rem;color:var(--teal);line-height:1}.rep-block span{color:#405d5a;font-size:.84rem;line-height:1.25}
    .sop-visual{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;gap:.7rem;align-items:center}.sop-stage{text-align:center;padding:.75rem}.sop-stage span{display:block;font-weight:850;color:#2e4055;margin-top:.7rem}.sop-stage small{display:block;color:#708090;font-size:.73rem}.flow-chevron{font-size:1.4rem;color:#9eafc1}.paper-stack{position:relative;width:80px;height:76px;margin:auto}.paper-stack i{position:absolute;inset:0;background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfcbd7;border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 5px 12px rgba(23,32,42,.08)}.paper-stack i:nth-child(1){transform:rotate(-9deg) translate(-8px,4px)}.paper-stack i:nth-child(2){transform:rotate(7deg) translate(8px,5px)}.paper-stack i:nth-child(3){background:linear-gradient(#fff 22%,#dfe8f1 23% 26%,#fff 27% 44%,#dfe8f1 45% 48%,#fff 49%)}.govern-ring{width:76px;height:76px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;margin:auto;background:#e8f2fd;border:7px solid #b8d6f4;color:var(--accent-2);font-weight:900;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #fff}.stage-library strong{display:block;font-size:2.65rem;color:var(--accent-2);line-height:1}.stage-library{padding:1.15rem .65rem;border-radius:18px;background:#edf5ff;border:1px solid #cfe1f4}
    .migration-visual{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(150px,.7fr) minmax(300px,1.6fr) minmax(170px,.8fr);align-items:center;gap:1rem;min-height:250px}.environment{padding:1.1rem;border-radius:18px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #d8dce9;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 9px 24px rgba(39,32,84,.07)}.environment span{display:block;font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.12em;font-weight:900;color:#7f72bd}.environment strong{font-size:.94rem}.new-env{background:#f2effd;border-color:#dcd6f1}.new-env small{display:block;margin-top:.55rem;color:#5c537b}.new-env b{color:var(--violet)}.migration-track{position:relative;min-height:150px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}.agency-cloud{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(9,1fr);gap:.3rem;margin:0 auto .6rem;width:82%}.agency-cloud i{width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:4px;background:#8579c8;box-shadow:0 3px 7px rgba(107,91,181,.18)}.agency-cloud i:nth-child(2n){background:#aaa0df;transform:translateY(5px)}.track-line{height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:#ddd8ef;overflow:hidden;position:relative}.track-line span{display:block;width:87%;height:100%;border-radius:inherit;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#6b5bb5,#8e82d1,#0f766e);position:relative}.track-line span:after{content:"";position:absolute;right:-1px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%) rotate(45deg);width:12px;height:12px;background:var(--teal)}.migration-label{text-align:center;margin-top:.65rem}.migration-label strong{font-size:1.35rem;color:var(--violet);margin-right:.35rem}.migration-label span{font-size:.8rem;color:#6b7080}.center-action{text-align:center;margin-top:1.8rem}
